  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb60f0b4\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-content vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div style=\"\" class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col padding-12-percent force-desktop-text-align-center inherit_tablet inherit_phone \" data-using-bg=\"true\" data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"0.5\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" ><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\" data-bg-pos=\"center center\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\" style=\" background-image: url('https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IMG_7995.2-1.jpg'); \"></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"nectar_single_testimonial\" data-color=\"default\" data-style=\"small_modern\"><div class=\"inner\"data-custom-color=\"true\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\"> <p><span class=\"open-quote\">&#8221;</span>Himalayan breathwork is hands down some of the most transformative meditation practices I have done. Rhea is a clear, grounded, loving, knowledgeable guide and teacher, who not only shares the practices, but also the meaning, intention and wisdom behind them. She holds a powerful container to guide the body into transcendent states of clarity. </p></div></blockquote>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"about-text\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\" data-top-percent=\"4%\" data-bottom-percent=\"2%\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section\"  style=\"padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.04); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.02); \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color\"  style=\"background-color: #ffffff; \"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col has-animation no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"fade-in-from-bottom\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1755210464622\" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"p1\">Kriya Breathwork and Sound Yoga</h3>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"598\">In 2019, I traveled to Rishikesh, India — the birthplace of yoga — to study under Himalayan masters and reconnect with my ancestral roots. There, on the banks of the Ganges in the Himalayan foothills, I earned my <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"501\">200-hour certification in ancient Vedic Kriya and Kundalini Breathwork</strong>. In 2020, I deepened my training with an additional <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"595\">100-hour Prenatal Kriya certification</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"959\"><strong>Kriya, meaning “action that leads to liberation,” is a powerful blend of breath, movement, and sound designed to clear energy channels, calm the nervous system, and connect us to higher consciousness.</strong> Unlike modern yoga’s focus on movement alone, Kriya works on the subtle body — <strong>detoxifying, awakening dormant energy, and aligning us with our dharmic path</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1204\">These ancient techniques have transformed my own life, leaving me feeling energetically clear, deeply connected to my soul, and grounded in purpose. <strong>Today, I share them to help others access the same inner stillness, vitality, and expansion.</strong></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-with-aniamtion-wrap \" data-max-width=\"100%\" data-max-width-mobile=\"default\" data-shadow=\"none\" data-animation=\"none\" >\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"hover-wrap\"> \n          <div class=\"hover-wrap-inner\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"img-with-animation skip-lazy\" data-delay=\"0\" height=\"2560\" width=\"2198\" data-animation=\"none\" src=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-scaled.jpg 2198w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-258x300.jpg 258w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-879x1024.jpg 879w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-768x894.jpg 768w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-1319x1536.jpg 1319w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC09729-Additional-Batch-1759x2048.jpg 1759w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2198px) 100vw, 2198px\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6127a6\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\" data-top-percent=\"2%\" data-bottom-percent=\"2%\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.02); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.02); \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding el_spacing_0px inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"testimonial_slider span_12 col font_size_desktop_1-3vw font_size_tablet_16px font_line_height_1-7 disable-height-animation\" data-color=\"\" data-rating-color=\"accent-color\" data-controls=\"default\" data-add-border=\"\" data-autorotate=\"5000\" data-style=\"default\" ><div class=\"slides\"><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea's guidance is deeply meaningful - you can tell that she believes deeply in the work and that the practice she shares is one she has invested in deeply herself. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Stephanie Ngan</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea's breathwork came at a time where I was really looking for new ways to dive in, and she offered exactly that. She is a knowledgeable and intuitive guide who helped me explore a new practice, and deepen my relationship with my body. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">SN</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Attending Rhea's kriya yoga session was a deeply transformative experience that touched me on multiple levels — physically, emotionally, and spiritually. During the practice, I felt a surprising physical release — a tingling in my spine and warmth in my chest — almost as if something dormant had begun to stir. Emotionally, I experienced waves of clarity and even unexpected tears, not from sadness, but from a feeling of being seen and cleansed. Spiritually, it felt like a homecoming — subtle but profound, like reconnecting with a part of myself I hadn’t realized I’d lost touch with. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Rachana Bontra</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea’s voice was beautiful and strong as she chanted the mantras, guiding us to tap into our intuitive strengths. Her guidance was clear and grounded, yet infused with something sacred. I left feeling lighter, more centered, and profoundly connected. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">RB</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea emits vibrant energy in her sessions. One can’t feel low and monotonous in her presence. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Himanshu</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb613b38\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">SNAPSHOT OF SESSIONS WITH RHEA</span></h3>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6146e1\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row  top_margin_0px right_margin_0px bottom_margin_0px left_margin_0px\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-3 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-center inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-3 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"wpb_video_widget wpb_content_element vc_clearfix   vc_video-aspect-ratio-916 vc_video-el-width-100 vc_video-align-left\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_video_wrapper\"><iframe title=\"Dr. Rhea Mehta Teaching Breath and Sound Yoga Session at Belong Festival in India\" width=\"174\" height=\"309\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AP0IRXcYdl8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-3 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"wpb_video_widget wpb_content_element vc_clearfix   vc_video-aspect-ratio-916 vc_video-el-width-100 vc_video-align-left\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_video_wrapper\"><iframe title=\"Kriya and Mantra Yoga Class in Toronto led by Dr. Rhea Mehta\" width=\"174\" height=\"309\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4ZtUdsEnbUY?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-3 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tabl